==English==

===Etymology===
The total number of counties in the island of Ireland.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{context|Ireland|British|lang=en}} {{non-gloss definition|Applied to the whole of the island of [[Ireland]], ignoring the distinction between the [[Republic of Ireland]] and [[Northern Ireland]].}}

===Usage notes===
* Used as a noun modifier, such as "32-county tour" or "32-county republic".

